      "title": "Career Success",
      "description": "Career Success - Longwood University There are active notices and/or alerts. Visit the Alerts site for details >> Academics Admissions Lancer Life About Us Visit Apply Give Lancer Dashboard Lancer Dashboard Today is Saturday, September 05, 2026 Services myLongwood Live Mail Canvas DegreeWorks Advising Lancer Web Card Center Student Housing Gateway (RMS) Lancer Link (Clubs & Orgs) Box Tk20 OTP Applications Watermark - Students Handshake Change My Password Dining Dining Locations, Hours & Menus Change Meal Plan Dining Services Website Information Help Desk LancerCard Career Success Greenwood Library Recreation / Fitness Center Bookstore Academic Departments & Programs All Offices & Services Resources Course Search Student Handbook Farmville Area Bus (FAB) Academic Calendar Exam Schedule How Do I... ? Suggestions/Complaints More Academic Resources Career Success Home Academics Academic Offices & Resources Career Success Empowering Students and Alumni on Their Professional Journeys We provide students and alumni with the opportunities and guidance they need to navigate their journeys to meaningful careers. From professional networking to career coaching to work-based experiences, we're here to help you succeed. Students Alumni Employers STUDENTS From one-on-one coaching to hands-on learning, we’re here to help you build a future that fits your goals. Student Services ALUMNI Support, wherever you are in your journey Whether you’re updating your resume, switching careers, or giving back, we’re here for you. You’ll find: Coaching and job search support Mentorship and volunteer opportunities Access to Handshake and career events Career Success Services for Alumni EMPLOYERS Connect with motivated Longwood talent. Post jobs, host internships, and meet students ready to make an impact. Employer Services Events For more information Center for Career Success career@longwood.edu (434) 395-2063 Make an Appointment Dr. Elizabeth Narehood Senior Director, Career and Professional Engagement Maugans G07 (434) 395-2066 narehoodem@longwood.edu Megan Miller Director, Campus Career Engagement Maugans G04 (434) 395-2064 millermp@longwood.edu John Glaeser Career Data and Outcomes Coordinator French 106C (434) 395-2056 glaeserjp@longwood.edu Danika Bellamy Sankar Director of Work-Based Experiences and Partnerships Maugans G08 (434) 395-2681 bellamysankard@longwood.edu Anna Hall Assistant Director, Career Pathways and Student Support Maugans G06 (434) 395-2810 halla3@longwood.edu About Us Admissions Academics Lancer Life Academic Calendar Bookstore Careers at Longwood Library A-Z Index Offices & Services Solomon (Faculty & Staff) Longwood University 201 High Street Farmville, VA 23909 (434) 395-2000 Maps & Directions Privacy Statement FOIA Student Consumer Information Non-Discrimination Statement Freedom of Expression Policies Alerts & Notices Longwood University Accessibility Statement © All rights reserved."
